  "body": "Draft. Plain wording for the work offset (issue #876), now including the review round.\n\n## Strings: before -> after\n- `crates/app/src/project/wcs_one.rs` load note (review blocker): \"...and G54-G59 is only the word its post writes\" -> \"...and G54-G59 is only the work offset its post uses\".\n- `crates/app/src/mcp/setup_tools.rs` tool description: \"Set the word (G54 to G59) the post writes for a declared setup's WCS; ...\" -> \"Set the work offset (G54 to G59) the post uses for a declared setup's WCS; ...\".\n- `crates/app/src/mcp/setup_tools.rs` schema description: \"The work-offset word to post; null clears it.\" -> \"The work offset to post (G54 to G59); null clears it.\" (field name `word` and the error text are unchanged).\n- `crates/ui/src/egui_app/pages.rs` WCS page line: \"Work offset: the G54-G59 register this setup posts. It does not move the origin.\" -> \"Work offset: the G54-G59 slot this setup posts. It does not move the origin.\"\n- Earlier round (unchanged): WCS page line from \"The work offset word is set per setup on the Setups page.\"; `SETUP_OFFSET_HINT` now names the WCS page or the Setups page; picker hover now \"Which of G54-G59 the posted program uses for this setup...\".\n\n## Sweep (git grep over crates for offset word / g-word / only the word / the word its)\n- Changed: wcs_one.rs load note, MCP descriptions (above).\n- Left: `app/src/mcp/setup_tools.rs` error \"unknown work offset '{s}' - the words are ...\" (error text clients may match on); `app/src/commands/setup_wcs.rs`, `app/src/setup.rs`, `project/file.rs`, `posting_wcs_*` comments and `app/tests/*` comments/asserts (comments keep the precise term; `app/tests/one_wcs.rs` pins \"no setup posted it\", unchanged); `app/tests/setup_wcs.rs` assert messages \"only the word moved\" (test-only text); `ui/src/egui_app/tests/one_wcs.rs` header comment.\n- \"furniture\" untouched (#878).\n\n## Tests\n- Pinning test (earlier round): `offset_hint_tests::offset_hint_names_the_real_pages_in_plain_words` (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/heights_page.rs`).\n- New (review round): `the_wcs_page_shows_the_work_offset_dropdown_and_no_setups_page_pointer` (`crates/ui/src/egui_app/tests/one_wcs.rs`): the WCS page paints the new line, no painted text on it contains \"Setups page\", and the work-offset combo reads G54. `structural::painted` made `pub(super)` to reuse it.\n- No existing test pinned the changed MCP description or the load note text (checked with git grep).\n\n## Run (CARGO_TARGET_DIR in worktree)\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-ui --lib` (from crates/ui): 522 passed, 0 failed, 5 ignored (includes both new tests).\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test mcp_setup`: 6 passed, 0 failed.\n- `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test one_wcs`: see the PR comment for the final result of this round.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: see the PR comment for the final result.\n- Not exercised: on-screen look of the wrapped line and the hover (no GUI launched); no snapshot PNG changed; no behaviour, command or posted-output change.\n\nChangelog: none (wording only)\n\nFixes #876\n",
